  "note": "PAID_WRITE_FEE_CEILING_OS is 18000000000 OS (18 DEM). assertWithinFeeCeiling(feeCeilingOs, fee) and assertWriteWithinFeeCeiling(feeCeilingOs, chain) compare the full getTransactionFees() result alone with the ceiling; the price, the release amount and the Agreement CREATE storage reserve are no longer added. The buyer's balance and total-debit check in assertBuyerFunds is unchanged. Factory options, construction order and the write-fee-cap refusal are unchanged. No core file changes, so the hold pins are unchanged."
